1
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:14,000
在这只鸟的体内，一个看不见的世界正在改变。
Within this bird, an unseen world was changing.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,500
一场微小的感染扩散开来。
A small infection spread.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
每只鸟跟随着附近的同伴。
Each bird follows its neighbours.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
保持距离。
Keeping distance.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
一同转向。
Turning together.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
留在群体附近。
Staying close.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,500
秩序，从这些微小的行动中涌现。
From these small actions, order emerges.

8
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,000
这只鸟死于急性肺炎。
This bird died of acute pneumonia.

9
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:45,000
鸟群仍在继续飞行。
The flock continued its flight.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
在下方，另一个世界也在运行。
Below, another world moves.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,000
人们相遇、交换、合作与竞争。
People meet, exchange, cooperate, and compete.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,500
他们的生活彼此交织，
Their lives intertwine,

13
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:15,000
形成任何一个人都无法独自创造的社会。
shaping a society no one person could create alone.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
世代之间，这些联系
Across generations, these connections

15
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,500
逐渐形成城市、文化与文明。
grow into cities, cultures, and civilizations.
